@UniConnect.Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{UniConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Login (platform admin)
POST {{UniConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "admin@demo.local",
  "password": "Demo123!"
}

### Platform — list tenants
GET {{UniConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### Platform — tenant dashboard
GET {{UniConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/tenants/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

### General Fleet — tenant tracking
GET {{UniConnect.Api_HostAddress}}/api/fleet/tenants/11111111-1111-1111-1111-111111111101/tracking
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json
